    "CLI/library/toolbox assets are surfaced through tasks, terminals, runbooks or curated actions rather than wrapped into a new extension by default.",
    "Project-specific profiles may live in separate repositories, but vendor client stacks should not be forked without a strong technical reason.",
    "Specialized heavy UI may remain external when reproducing it inside VS Code would reduce capability."
  ],
